# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are recorded here, following [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/).

## [Unreleased]

### Changed

- 2026-11-11 18:46 The project is now called Momako. Packages are `@momako/core`, `@momako/hud` and `@momako/cli`, the templates are `momako-er`, `momako-san` and so on, and the scaffold command is `momako create`.
- 2026-11-11 18:40 The 2D (er) and 3D (san) templates now share one layout: game code lives under `src/modules/game`, game text and credits under `src/modules/meta-info`, and common code under `src/shared`.
- 2026-11-11 18:40 The 3D template's game is split into a page, a scene, small reusable pieces and a plain game-state module, so it is easier to extend. Gameplay is unchanged.

### Fixed

- 2026-11-11 18:40 The 3D template's About page now shows the team name, which was previously read from the wrong field.

### Removed

- 2026-11-11 18:40 The 2D template no longer ships unused logo images or an outdated `CODEBASE_STATE.md`.
